   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nHere is the output i get by printing the results from nearPoints() after clicking on a square. I can get the coordinates, but I need to obtain the row and column names corresponding to the square I clicked.<div><br><div style=\"border:1px solid rgb(187,187,187);word-wrap:break-word;background-color:rgb(250,250,250)\"><code><div><span style=\"color:#000\">input$plot_click</span><span style=\"color:#660\">:</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br><br>$x <br><br></span><span style=\"color:#660\">[</span><span style=\"color:#066\">1</span><span style=\"color:#660\">]</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">0.8087657</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br><br>$y <br><br></span><span style=\"color:#660\">[</span><span style=\"color:#066\">1</span><span style=\"color:#660\">]</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">0.3461</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> <br><br>$mapping <br><br>named list</span><span style=\"color:#660\">()</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> <br><br>$domain <br><br>$domain$left <br><br></span><span style=\"color:#660\">[</span><span style=\"color:#066\">1</span><span style=\"color:#660\">]</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">-</span><span style=\"color:#066\">0.04</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> <br><br>$domain$right <br><br></span><span style=\"color:#660\">[</span><span style=\"color:#066\">1</span><span style=\"color:#660\">]</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">1.04</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> <br><br>$domain$bottom <br><br></span><span style=\"color:#660\">[</span><span style=\"color:#066\">1</span><span style=\"color:#660\">]</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">-</span><span style=\"color:#066\">0.04</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> <br><br>$domain$top <br><br></span><span style=\"color:#660\">[</span><span style=\"color:#066\">1</span><span style=\"color:#660\">]</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">1.04</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> <br><br>$range <br><br>$range$left <br><br></span><span style=\"color:#660\">[</span><span style=\"color:#066\">1</span><span style=\"color:#660\">]</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">0</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> <br><br>$range$right <br><br></span><span style=\"color:#660\">[</span><span style=\"color:#066\">1</span><span style=\"color:#660\">]</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">397</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> <br><br>$range$bottom <br><br></span><span style=\"color:#660\">[</span><span style=\"color:#066\">1</span><span style=\"color:#660\">]</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">399</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> <br><br>$range$top <br><br></span><span style=\"color:#660\">[</span><span style=\"color:#066\">1</span><span style=\"color:#660\">]</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">-</span><span style=\"color:#066\">1</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> <br><br>$log <br><br>$log$x <br><br>NULL <br><br><br>$log$y <br><br>NULL <br><br><br>$</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#000\">nonce <br><br></span><span style=\"color:#660\">[</span><span style=\"color:#066\">1</span><span style=\"color:#660\">]</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">0.6781342</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br><br></span></div></code></div></div></div>"
    ],
    [
